<title>USA: CCC amends Bangladesh tender to include soft wheat.</title>
<headline>CCC amends Bangladesh tender to include soft wheat.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it had amended its tender to buy up to 80,000 tonnes of wheat for export to Bangladesh.</p>
<p>It had originally sought only hard red winter wheat but has now added soft red winter and soft white wheat to the tender options.</p>
<p>The wheat is for December 1-25 shipment and offers must be submitted by November 13 for reply the following day.</p>
<p>--Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
